le (Phase 2a RCT vs Phase I/IIa single-arm) -> Contrast results across settings (1st-line vs refractory) -> Explain mechanistic/contextual factors (engraftment durability, immune milieu, donor matching) -> Conclude with current status/pending Phase III.\n    *   Ensure tone matches academic review. No overgeneralization. Keep distinctions clear.\n\n    Draft structure:\n    截至现有文献（2025–2026年），尚无已完成的、大规模随机对照 III 期试验证实微生物组干预在 ICI 治疗患者中的确切疗效，相关证据目前仍停留在 I 期安全性探索与 IIa 期初步有效性阶段。最高级别证据来自 TACITO 试验（转移性肾细胞癌一线联合治疗），其为随机双盲安慰剂对照 IIa 期研究，虽未达到预设的 12 个月无进展生存率主要终点，但显著延长了中位 PFS，且总生存呈有利趋势；相比之下，针对 ICI 耐药患者的 MITRIC 试验（单臂 IIa 期篮式试验）显示客观缓解率为 0%，提示在快速进展、高度预治疗的难治性人群中 FMT 难以发挥挽救性疗效。早期单臂 I 期研究（如 MIMic 试验，晚期黑色素瘤）报告了较高的缓解率与较长的生存期，但因缺乏对照臂，结果仅具假设生成价值。机制层面，供体菌株定植多为短暂性，仅临床获益者观察到长期定植；免疫微环境分析表明，基线髓系优势（高 CD14+ 单核细胞）与高血清 IL-8 预示不良预后，而活化 T 细胞特征则与改善生存相关，这些免疫表型更多反映宿主基础疾病状态而非 FMT 的直接干预效应。此外，供体选择（ICI 应答者 vs 健康人）、给药途径、患者异质性及地域/饮食导致的菌群差异，均使疗效呈现高度情境依赖性。目前可靠生物标志物尚未确立，FMT 的最佳适用人群、供受体匹配标准及优化方案仍需后续 III 期随机对照试验进一步验证。\n\n6.  **Check Constraints:**\n    *   `quantitative_comparisons`: Formatted correctly? Yes. I will list them out.\n    *   `usable_content`: Starts with differentiating findings? Yes. Explains meaning without repeating numbers? Yes. Doesn't synthesize into universal mechanism? Yes. Keeps distinctions? Yes.\n    *   `decision`: `direct_use` (answers the existence question definitively based on provided literature, notes temporal boundary).\n    *   `still_missing`: Phase III RCT data.\n    *   `read_focus`: Focus on ongoing/completed Phase III registries or recent publications post-2026 if any, though current scope is satisfied.\n    *   `external_ask`: Request confirmation of any Phase III RCTs completed after the 2025/2026 publication window, specifically looking for registered trials (e.g., ME.17 Phase II mentioned, but need actual Phase III) with published primary endpoints (OS/PFS).\n    *   `reason`: Materials explicitly detail Phase I/IIa status, contrast efficacy across treatment lines (refrac